n1566_p0057c01","n":"0057c","t":"說若世諦中如是說者汝義自"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0058a01","n":"0058a","t":"能緣者是義相應諸部論師亦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0058b01","n":"0058b","t":"無間故次第緣成是故無過者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0058c01","n":"0058c","t":"勝功德世諦法故非第一義以"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0059a01","n":"0059a","t":"義不應爾何以故以果故譬如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0059b01","n":"0059b","t":"釋曰諸緣非緣自體不有偈義"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0059c01","n":"0059c","t":"般若燈論釋卷第三偈本龍樹"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0060a01","n":"0060a","t":"何未去謂彼去者未有起作以"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0060b01","n":"0060b","t":"所執不歡喜故復次僧佉人言"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0060c01","n":"0060c","t":"是義不然何以故此一去業屬"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0061a01","n":"0061a","t":"者去時得成第一義中與此相"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0061b01","n":"0061b","t":"兔無角不可指示言有角也今"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0061c01","n":"0061c","t":"別有異者與彼去合是義不然"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0062a01","n":"0062a","t":"釋曰如去無體我先已說令他"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0062b01","n":"0062b","t":"已去中無發未去亦無發去時"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0062c01","n":"0062c","t":"分別不起此義云何偈曰無已"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0063a01","n":"0063a","t":"釋曰去住相違於一時中不得"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0063b01","n":"0063b","t":"已住未住住時及住初發亦不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0063c01","n":"0063c","t":"釋曰如是語義顛倒過咎如聲"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0064a01","n":"0064a","t":"等彼說異者亦不欲令離去有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0064b01","n":"0064b","t":"此驗知轉不轉聲因非一向故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0064c01","n":"0064c","t":"無去者去以作動故如彼餘物"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0065a01","n":"0065a","t":"聚集別名身種彼塵增長故稱"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0065b01","n":"0065b","t":"體外無異去去何以故以不合"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0065c01","n":"0065c","t":"善男子如來者無所從來亦無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0066a01","n":"0066a","t":"等根各各增上聚集有作能取"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0066b01","n":"0066b","t":"義不然何以故無二過故謂非"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0066c01","n":"0066c","t":"耳等如是第一義中所取色塵"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0067a01","n":"0067a","t":"色識因故譬如彼色復次僧佉"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0067b01","n":"0067b","t":"何已說偈曰去未去去時已總"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0067c01","n":"0067c","t":"丈夫者此義不然以與世間所"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0068a01","n":"0068a","t":"色空明及以作意此等有故有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0068b01","n":"0068b","t":"不然何以故彼識等果四種有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0068c01","n":"0068c","t":"此是無上諦世間不能了又如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0069a01","n":"0069a","t":"色聲句義境界無實何以故以"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0069b01","n":"0069b","t":"非一向過何以故如不取燈則"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0069c01","n":"0069c","t":"說無因種耶不欲令爾如偈曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0070a01","n":"0070a","t":"是故於色境不應生分別釋曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0070b01","n":"0070b","t":"亦如是遮更無異門故非非一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0070c01","n":"0070c","t":"以故同前遮故一切不能與空"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0071a01","n":"0071a","t":"語為證如經言佛告大王界有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0071b01","n":"0071b","t":"諸因應如是廣說復次鞞世師"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0071c01","n":"0071c","t":"曰離有相無相異處亦不轉釋"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0072a01","n":"0072a","t":"離所相能相是體亦不有釋曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0072b01","n":"0072b","t":"體此之解者為是有體為是無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0072c01","n":"0072c","t":"釋曰如是不著有體不著無體"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0073a01","n":"0073a","t":"般若燈論釋卷第四般若燈論"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0073b01","n":"0073b","t":"復次阿毘曇人言如我偈曰染"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0073c01","n":"0073c","t":"過論者偈曰有染復染者何處"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0074a01","n":"0074a","t":"釋曰若言同時即有二體偈意"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0074b01","n":"0074b","t":"不然如偈曰如是別不成求欲"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0074c01","n":"0074c","t":"復次成立此品其相云何陰等"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0075a01","n":"0075a","t":"義中起是無為而作有為諸法"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0075b01","n":"0075b","t":"者亦非實有又有觀故住分別"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0075c01","n":"0075c","t":"若是無為如所說過今還屬汝"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0076a01","n":"0076a","t":"句謂起時未起第四句謂根本"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0076b01","n":"0076b","t":"生故如未生子無所作業燈亦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0076c01","n":"0076c","t":"釋曰由已起故生於彼起則無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0077a01","n":"0077a","t":"由諸法無性自體非有故此有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0077b01","n":"0077b","t":"法有體云何驗知來現世故此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0077c01","n":"0077c","t":"無諸緣義應爾又如偈言非有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0078a01","n":"0078a","t":"體可得故論者偈曰若法無滅"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0078b01","n":"0078b","t":"如起不自起亦不從他起釋曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0078c01","n":"0078c","t":"無住彼分別滅二俱不然如偈"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0079a01","n":"0079a","t":"滅二俱不然如偈曰法不自體"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0079b01","n":"0079b","t":"二法相待由此因故第一義中"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0079c01","n":"0079c","t":"相但彼凡夫愚癡妄執分別有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0080a01","n":"0080a","t":"此解者於義不然如其不然應"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0080b01","n":"0080b","t":"觀作業有實作者虛妄分別於"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0080c01","n":"0080c","t":"釋曰於世間中瓶衣等物亦有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0081a01","n":"0081a","t":"釋曰於一物體一剎那中有及"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0081b01","n":"0081b","t":"外更無異因能成業義如是外"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0081c01","n":"0081c","t":"譬不成立義亦壞若言諸法不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0082a01","n":"0082a","t":"不可得故我無過復次異僧佉"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0082b01","n":"0082b","t":"不受耶為立驗故不受耶為一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0082c01","n":"0082c","t":"以是故當知先有此住體釋曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0083a01","n":"0083a","t":"釋曰或有取了人者謂眼等諸"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0083b01","n":"0083b","t":"非第一義中彼見者體不異聞"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0083c01","n":"0083c","t":"義中取者無體何以故以緣起"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0084a01","n":"0084a","t":"驗無體故有分別滅有既滅故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0084b01","n":"0084b","t":"如此雖先已破今當復遮汝應"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0084c01","n":"0084c","t":"釋曰無可燒相業無體故而不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0085a01","n":"0085a","t":"陀臘脾毘佉反唐言實如是三"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0085b01","n":"0085b","t":"此物共彼物異者則不然外人"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0085c01","n":"0085c","t":"中觀不成故因義不成亦譬喻"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0086a01","n":"0086a","t":"如是說復次觀察彼者如偈曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0086b01","n":"0086b","t":"薪火一異遮無體故由如此義"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0086c01","n":"0086c","t":"中如理諦觀若一若異此體不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0087a01","n":"0087a","t":"見此已故說是言生死長遠猶"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0087b01","n":"0087b","t":"亦不然何以故虛妄分別生死"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0087c01","n":"0087c","t":"師幻作丈夫於彼相續求中體"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0088a01","n":"0088a","t":"釋曰何故不然生時即死無如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0088b01","n":"0088b","t":"牛體先無如此義何以故依止"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0088c01","n":"0088c","t":"共作無因作彼果皆不然釋曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0089a01","n":"0089a","t":"諦中相似相續因果不別世間"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0089b01","n":"0089b","t":"造業自受果者是義不然何以"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0089c01","n":"0089c","t":"曰苦不還作苦釋曰如先偈言"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0090a01","n":"0090a","t":"故如前已說又從緣起故如芽"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0090b01","n":"0090b","t":"乘經中亦作是說諸有為法皆"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0090c01","n":"0090c","t":"釋曰諸法無我我所故汝義如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0091a01","n":"0091a","t":"相離故如是此因令人信解如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0091b01","n":"0091b","t":"亦同前遮如是觀察第一義中"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0091c01","n":"0091c","t":"諦境界真實觀一切法猶如虛"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0092a01","n":"0092a","t":"此執著空有何過失如偈曰說"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0092b01","n":"0092b","t":"為合由我說因符正道理是故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0092c01","n":"0092c","t":"釋曰如前所說道理彼聞可聞"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0093a01","n":"0093a","t":"以故由總別故譬如色體復次"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0093b01","n":"0093b","t":"自體是品中義是故得成如般"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0093c01","n":"0093c","t":"起而汝意欲此無體者則違現"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0094a01","n":"0094a","t":"體無故是故出因非非一向於"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0094b01","n":"0094b","t":"是故亦非因義不成復次偈曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0094c01","n":"0094c","t":"自他及有體無體彼則不能見"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0095a01","n":"0095a","t":"不成若僧佉人作如是言汝先"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0095b01","n":"0095b","t":"不破於世諦中有變異故亦非"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0095c01","n":"0095c","t":"有無是二邊淨不淨亦爾是故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0096a01","n":"0096a","t":"差別無流轉者今諸行無常應"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0096b01","n":"0096b","t":"是故當知無一法從此世至後"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0096c01","n":"0096c","t":"釋曰無流轉故云何驗知第一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0097a01","n":"0097a","t":"是無常乎若汝欲令第一義中"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0097b01","n":"0097b","t":"界何以故由覺故譬如緣瓶等"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0097c01","n":"0097c","t":"俱無解脫有過失故不可說者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0098a01","n":"0098a","t":"故以同時故如調達體復次已"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0098b01","n":"0098b","t":"縛復欲取解若如此者有縛解"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0098c01","n":"0098c","t":"立又為令彼厭離生死作如是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0099a01","n":"0099a","t":"般若燈論釋卷第十偈本龍樹"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0099b01","n":"0099b","t":"不善故名為無記又無記者不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0099c01","n":"0099c","t":"色令他解者名為作色不以身"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0100a01","n":"0100a","t":"俱不壞者難令物解汝非無過"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0100b01","n":"0100b","t":"相續起此相續果起者謂愛非"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0100c01","n":"0100c","t":"續相似法體者不然何以故種"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0101a01","n":"0101a","t":"毀其本券如是如是不失法能"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0101b01","n":"0101b","t":"不失法起總持諸業不相似者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0101c01","n":"0101c","t":"何名不失法謂佛於處處經中"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0102a01","n":"0102a","t":"無起者彼即無壞汝今欲得受"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0102b01","n":"0102b","t":"償故業亦如是由有體在還得"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0102c01","n":"0102c","t":"醜等種種果報無有自體如說"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0103a01","n":"0103a","t":"既無有此果何有受果者釋曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0103b01","n":"0103b","t":"無智者不應依汝言撥無業果"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0103c01","n":"0103c","t":"不作決定業決定無作者不作"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0104a01","n":"0104a","t":"無後世若說無邊亦無後世何"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0104b01","n":"0104b","t":"聚諸根諸根聚諸識等為我論"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0104c01","n":"0104c","t":"等具僧佉鞞世師等謂論者言"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0105a01","n":"0105a","t":"作是說者其義不然亦如有人"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0105b01","n":"0105b","t":"是若無我者先所見物後見還"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0105c01","n":"0105c","t":"設故彼師子境界不如其義復"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0106a01","n":"0106a","t":"前過答諸行者應如是觀察實"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0106b01","n":"0106b","t":"盡諸取盡故則生盡生盡故得"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0106c01","n":"0106c","t":"如經偈言佛為殺生者略說不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0107a01","n":"0107a","t":"分別境界無故以是故世諦之"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0107b01","n":"0107b","t":"為說息言語斷彼心境界亦無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0107c01","n":"0107c","t":"相無作寂滅無戲論故自部及"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0108a01","n":"0108a","t":"世諦中是實如佛言所有內外"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0108b01","n":"0108b","t":"實相非是文字不可言說為欲"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0108c01","n":"0108c","t":"故不斷亦不常復次雖因壞已"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0109a01","n":"0109a","t":"是無我乃至受想行識非是我"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0109b01","n":"0109b","t":"見提婆達多境界與杖合者亦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0109c01","n":"0109c","t":"言現在未來於過去中得同時"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0110a01","n":"0110a","t":"同名為人於中而有差別功德"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0110b01","n":"0110b","t":"可取不可取云何可施設釋曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0110c01","n":"0110c","t":"色等識鞞世師人復言定有實"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0111a01","n":"0111a","t":"若波羅蜜復次須菩提若非色"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0111b01","n":"0111b","t":"言生者和合中則無何以故有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0111c01","n":"0111c","t":"故因中果有取汝雖言現量不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0112a01","n":"0112a","t":"無如是驗還同上非因緣過欲"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0112b01","n":"0112b","t":"生二故譬如父子二如先所說"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0112c01","n":"0112c","t":"因滅者已壞云何能生果釋曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0113a01","n":"0113a","t":"酪因譬如乳與瓶論者言汝說"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0113b01","n":"0113b","t":"遮此過故如論偈說未起果不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0113c01","n":"0113c","t":"是若果以無他體為體者此果"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0114a01","n":"0114a","t":"說果空云何生以此觀察第一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0114b01","n":"0114b","t":"是故果不從緣合不合生以果"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0114c01","n":"0114c","t":"離壞無有成與俱亦無成釋曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0115a01","n":"0115a","t":"體復有正量部人言法雖無常"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0115b01","n":"0115b","t":"有盡者無壞無盡亦無壞釋曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0115c01","n":"0115c","t":"依一物譬如餘物體此亦因義"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0116a01","n":"0116a","t":"義中欲得有體者今當說過如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0116b01","n":"0116b","t":"過如論偈說先有自體者後無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0116c01","n":"0116c","t":"耶外人答言如彼所說有相續"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0117a01","n":"0117a","t":"般若燈論釋卷第十三偈本龍"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0117b01","n":"0117b","t":"中無藥不得言有藥陰中無如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0117c01","n":"0117c","t":"不然火等有起先已遮故如是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0118a01","n":"0118a","t":"釋曰此謂離取如來不成何以"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0118b01","n":"0118b","t":"羅樹云何問言氣味形色佛言"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0118c01","n":"0118c","t":"取及取者空及一切種空釋曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0119a01","n":"0119a","t":"戲論故三界所不攝故是出世"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0119b01","n":"0119b","t":"來無一切智何以故如來不記"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0119c01","n":"0119c","t":"披讀文字章句譬如僧佉論文"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0120a01","n":"0120a","t":"若無自體者云何有他體釋曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0120b01","n":"0120b","t":"止聲復次若以第一義令信解"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0120c01","n":"0120c","t":"相無作無願如幻如夢等悉是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0121a01","n":"0121a","t":"如觀入品說入無自體已令開"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0121b01","n":"0121b","t":"如是身者非實非生亦非大等"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0121c01","n":"0121c","t":"善不善顛倒從此緣而起釋曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0122a01","n":"0122a","t":"生不可得若離眾生煩惱無屬"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0122b01","n":"0122b","t":"故第一義中煩惱非是從緣起"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0122c01","n":"0122c","t":"而能起現與形相似故以是因"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0123a01","n":"0123a","t":"智者當斷此二種顛倒為是智"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0123b01","n":"0123b","t":"者言汝義不然如論偈說執具"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0123c01","n":"0123c","t":"離已未倒者有合時不然釋曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0124a01","n":"0124a","t":"為有實體為無實體今何所問"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0124b01","n":"0124b","t":"般若燈論釋觀聖諦品第二十"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0124c01","n":"0124c","t":"爾故論偈言若無有僧寶則無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0125a01","n":"0125a","t":"無起亦無滅汝作如是說者亦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0125b01","n":"0125b","t":"說有持戒修定生住滅等諸法"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0125c01","n":"0125c","t":"不饒益事如論偈說諸佛以是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0126a01","n":"0126a","t":"如幻故第一義中見無起等名"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0126b01","n":"0126b","t":"非自非他亦非俱非不俱所有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0126c01","n":"0126c","t":"亦所不信何況第一義耶以是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0127a01","n":"0127a","t":"不解苦自體亦不解苦因釋曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0127b01","n":"0127b","t":"意謂亦不長小令大亦不了闇"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0127c01","n":"0127c","t":"謂無作者名住自體以不壞故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0128a01","n":"0128a","t":"釋觀聖諦品竟般若燈論釋卷"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0128b01","n":"0128b","t":"真實理而說有自體者得涅槃"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0128c01","n":"0128c","t":"涅槃非是體無老死相故譬如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0129a01","n":"0129a","t":"若無因無緣是名為涅槃釋曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0129b01","n":"0129b","t":"俱不可說彼向言有二體過及"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0129c01","n":"0129c","t":"死令開解者如論偈說生死際"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0130a01","n":"0130a","t":"別習氣過故然此分別無有自"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0130b01","n":"0130b","t":"亦不起以是故名戲論息吉祥"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0130c01","n":"0130c","t":"證故一切諸法皆先佛已說今"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0131a01","n":"0131a","t":"化身從此化身起於說法由第"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0131b01","n":"0131b","t":"一切相皆寂滅是為涅槃一切"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0131c01","n":"0131c","t":"亦非獨無明覆障眾生更有諸"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0132a01","n":"0132a","t":"依止陰而有相續從死剎那至"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0132b01","n":"0132b","t":"依止處故名清淨色為耳等入"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0132c01","n":"0132c","t":"今現見因受果名故譬如佛出"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0133a01","n":"0133a","t":"不見諸行無始已來展轉從緣"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0133b01","n":"0133b","t":"自部人言有自體五取陰是見"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0133c01","n":"0133c","t":"我相異取相者如上偈說若離"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0134a01","n":"0134a","t":"如論偈說今世無過去是事亦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0134b01","n":"0134b","t":"或有如是見來世有我起來世"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0134c01","n":"0134c","t":"非常非無常汝意亦得成釋曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0135a01","n":"0135a","t":"邊者不然如所說驗義者應如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0135b01","n":"0135b","t":"中有如是五取陰自體是見處"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0135c01","n":"0135c","t":"般若波羅蜜今以無起等差別"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T30n1566_p0136a01","n":"0136a","t":"般若燈論釋卷第十五"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T30n1566-般若燈論釋","source":"CBETA T30n1566 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":257,"unit":"T30 頁欄"}